<title>CANADA: Denison Mines names Farmer president, CEO.</title>
<headline>Denison Mines names Farmer president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denison Mines Ltd said on Tuesday that Peter Farmer was appointed president and chief executive, replacing Bill James, effective immediately.</p>
<p>James, who became chief executive of Inmet Mining Corp last September, was named vice-chairman of Denison's board of directors.</p>
<p>Denison said Farmer joined the company in 1985 as general counsel and secretary before becoming vice-president in 1987 and a director in 1995.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
